cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Bu depoyu kullanırsanız lütfen şöyle atıf verin. / If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "PETRI: Emergent zihin öncülleri deneyi. Ön-kayıtlı koşum günlüğü ve bulgular"
abstract: >-
  Pre-registered artificial-life experiment testing whether precursors of
  consciousness (self-model, mutual modelling, compositional communication)
  emerge spontaneously in mortal predictive agents with a costly signalling
  channel, with every prior counted in bits. Main result (H4): negative. A
  silent equilibrium was measured, in which listener learning requires about
  0.18 bits of sender clarity while ecological senders stay at 0.05 to 0.10 bits.
authors:
